{
  "name": "Fiscal DARF — captura stub homolog (n8n → inbox)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f2a00001-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Manual trigger fiscal DARF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "external_event_id",
              "value": "=fiscal-darf-stub-{{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b2",
              "name": "tenant_header",
              "value": "={{ $env.TENANT_ID_HEADER || 'demo' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b3",
              "name": "portal_cliente_id",
              "value": "={{ $env.FISCAL_PORTAL_CLIENTE_ID || 'SUBSTITUIR-UUID-CLIENTE' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b4",
              "name": "competencia",
              "value": "={{ $env.FISCAL_COMPETENCIA || '2026-06' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b5",
              "name": "codigo_receita",
              "value": "={{ $env.FISCAL_DARF_CODIGO_RECEITA || '0561' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b6",
              "name": "periodo_apuracao",
              "value": "={{ $env.FISCAL_DARF_PERIODO_APURACAO || ($json.competencia + '-30') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b7",
              "name": "idempotency_key",
              "value": "=escritorio:{{ $json.portal_cliente_id }}:{{ $json.competencia }}:DARF",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f2a00002-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Payload fiscal DARF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [260, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ ($env.API_BASE_URL || 'http://host.docker.internal:3333') + '/v1/inbox/webhooks' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "X-Tenant-Id", "value": "={{ $json.tenant_header }}" },
            { "name": "X-Webhook-Secret", "value": "={{ $env.WEBHOOK_INBOX_SECRET }}" },
            { "name": "X-External-Event-Id", "value": "={{ $json.external_event_id }}" },
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"event_type\": \"fiscal.capture.requested\",\n  \"portal_cliente_id\": \"{{ $json.portal_cliente_id }}\",\n  \"tipo_guia\": \"DARF\",\n  \"competencia\": \"{{ $json.competencia }}\",\n  \"codigo_receita\": \"{{ $json.codigo_receita }}\",\n  \"periodo_apuracao\": \"{{ $json.periodo_apuracao }}\",\n  \"idempotency_key\": \"{{ $json.idempotency_key }}\"\n}",
        "options": { "response": { "response": { "fullResponse": true } } }
      },
      "id": "f2a00003-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "POST inbox fiscal DARF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [520, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Fiscal DARF stub homolog (Fase 2.5)\n\nRequer na API:\n- `FISCAL_GUIAS_ENABLED=true`\n- `FISCAL_CAPTURE_STUB=true` **ou** mock Receita `:19443` + worker real\n- Redis + worker `fiscal-capture`\n\nVariáveis n8n:\n- `FISCAL_PORTAL_CLIENTE_ID` — UUID em portal.cliente\n- `FISCAL_COMPETENCIA` — YYYY-MM\n- `FISCAL_DARF_CODIGO_RECEITA` — ex. 0561 (default)\n- `FISCAL_DARF_PERIODO_APURACAO` — YYYY-MM-DD (default: competencia + '-30')\n\nPar DAS: `fiscal-capture-stub-homolog.workflow.json`",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "f2a00004-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, 60]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual trigger fiscal DARF": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Payload fiscal DARF", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Payload fiscal DARF": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "POST inbox fiscal DARF", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  }
}
